  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for glib2",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for glib2 fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-15588: GDBusServer pre-authentication DoS via unbounded SASL line buffering (bsc#1272206).\n\nChanges for glib2:\n\n- Fix segfault when monitoring hard links (bsc#1281419).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
